{"id":"tegami-mqoweokv","createdAt":"2026-06-22T07:32:51.823Z","version":"0.0.0","changelogs":{"fake-bold-threshold.md":{"filename":"fake-bold-threshold.md","packages":{"cargo:takumi":"patch","cargo:takumi-core":"patch","cargo:takumi-raster":"patch","cargo:takumi-svg":"patch","npm:takumi-js":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/core":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":"patch"},"sections":[{"depth":3,"title":"Match browser fake-bold for synthesized weights","content":"Synthesize bold only at the CSS bold threshold (weight >= 600), so a medium weight keeps its regular face instead of being faux-bolded. Scale the synthetic stroke with text size — `1/24` easing to `1/32` per Skia — instead of a constant fraction, so large text is no longer over-emboldened."}]},"font-registration-metadata.md":{"filename":"font-registration-metadata.md","packages":{"cargo:takumi":"patch","cargo:takumi-core":"patch","npm:takumi-js":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/core":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":"patch","npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":"patch"},"sections":[{"depth":3,"title":"Keep font metadata when registering loaded fonts","content":"`registerFont` passed only the resolved bytes to the engine, dropping each descriptor's\n`name`/`subsetOf`/`weight`/`style`. Subsets that should register under unique names collapsed\nonto their intrinsic family, so coverage variants were lost — text rendered as tofu, and which\nvariant survived depended on fetch-completion order, so the same content rendered differently\neach run. Forward the descriptor so the override reaches the engine."},{"depth":3,"title":"Key the glyph cache by blob id instead of pointer","content":"A freed font blob's address gets reused by a later font, aliasing its cached glyphs. Use the\nblob's stable, never-reused id."}]},"google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md":{"filename":"google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md","packages":{"cargo:takumi":"minor","cargo:takumi-core":"minor","npm:takumi-js":"minor","npm:@takumi-rs/core":"minor","npm:@takumi-rs/helpers":"minor","npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":"minor","npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":"minor"},"sections":[{"depth":3,"title":"Load only the Google Font subsets the content needs","content":"`googleFontSubsets(content, families)` scans the codepoints a render uses, fetches every family's metadata in one css2 request, and keeps just the matching `unicode-range` subsets, so a multilingual image pulls a handful of CJK blocks instead of a whole font. Pass a `cache` Map to reuse the CSS across renders."},{"depth":3,"title":"Group coverage subsets under one logical family","content":"`FontResource::subset_of` (Rust) and the `subsetOf` font field (JS) register a font as a subset of a logical family. A render expands `font-family: {logical}` into every subset registered under it, in order, so each script routes to the subset that covers it — distinct families no longer share a single fallback chain."}]}},"packages":{"npm:@takumi-rs/core":{"type":"minor","changelogIds":["fake-bold-threshold.md","font-registration-metadata.md","google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":{"type":"minor","changelogIds":["fake-bold-threshold.md","font-registration-metadata.md","google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/helpers":{"type":"minor","changelogIds":["google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:takumi-js":{"type":"minor","changelogIds":["fake-bold-threshold.md","font-registration-metadata.md","google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":{"type":"minor","changelogIds":["fake-bold-threshold.md","font-registration-metadata.md","google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-core":{"type":"minor","changelogIds":["fake-bold-threshold.md","font-registration-metadata.md","google-fonts-dynamic-subset.md"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-svg":{"type":"pat